      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹13.54 (vs ₹10.46 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹13.54 (up from ₹10.46 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹32.4b (up 2.4% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.37b (up 30% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 7.3% (up from 5.8% in FY 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 8.1% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 3.8% growth forecast for the Transportation industry in Asia. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 23% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 11% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
